      "message": "@dawidn@google.com\n@tomhughes@chromium.org\nThis comment and the implementation does not seem aligned to me. It reads `The maximum error threshold is two ticks.` I understand it that it should be translated to `(USEC_PER_SEC / CONFIG_SYS_CLOCK_TICKS_PER_SEC) + 2`.\nCan you please advise?",
