        "id": 1314845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-20T16:21:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it\u0027s ok as written?\n\n`(USEC_PER_SEC / CONFIG_SYS_CLOCK_TICKS_PER_SEC)` should result in a value of `usec  / clock tick`. Then we multiply by two clock ticks, which gives us `usec`.",
      "parentUuid": "58755617_1b91c566",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 28,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 31,
        "endChar": 54
      },
      "revId": "bfc398d7035604c2d5071f5d97e39c3ce10bd833",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d16ccb8c_c5952be4",
